      }) with { supersedes = { "01a1514d-8af5-7fa1-a4c2-70be8785fb2e"; }; };
    (h.req "01a1b49c-ac78-753e-ac8a-cb32f9c2e19e"
      "The judge is run against its honest transcript and then refused every corruption of it before the real run is judged: 44 corrupted transcripts, 18 corrupted hand-off records and 6 corrupted reference checks, 68 in all. The transcript controls are an empty transcript, a line that is not an undeclare exam line, an unrecognised kind of line, a replay line with an extra field, a replay of a batch the peer did not send, the undeclaration replayed twice, two pairs of replays swapped, a replay that did not end in ok, the two scenarios swapped, a property that failed, a refusal reported twice and a refusal the exam does not name, the replay of each of the eight batches missing, each of the two scenarios missing, the undeclaration's property missing, and, for each of the ten refusals, the line missing and the line with another class. The count is exact."
      "Zenoh Profile 0 session taking a stock peer's undeclaration by subscriber id"
