      "A system spec `sel4-zenoh-service` declares an instance `zenoh-service` with its executable, a network application row for it, a grants list and the grants object. The manifest derived from it holds the same. One entry of the composition inventory names the composition and the owning gate `zenoh_service_booted_check`, and a test-run record names its closure."
      "Plan the Zenoh service composition and its booted exchange"
