    (h.req "01a1b49c-ae50-71fd-a429-4b473b2bf634"
      "`RELEASE_INPUTS` lists `scripts/lib/zenoh_grants_table.py` and the directory `contracts/zenoh-service-grants-table/v1`. An edit to either changes a closure identity, so a generation that carries grants cannot change without its closure changing."
      "Plan the Zenoh service composition and its booted exchange"
      {
        h.observedWhere "cases-observed" "zenoh_service_booted_check" { h.count "casesObserved" 19; } "The checker counts 19 cases. 18 are declarations that the files must hold, and one is the booted run. The count is exact. Only the booted run shows the holders exchanging through the service.";
      }) with { supersedes = { "01a19c29-056e-79a2-81a5-7d833c275b40"; }; };
    (h.req "01a1b49c-ae50-71fd-a429-4b4852f0e576"
      "`check-sel4-io-network-plane.py` offers the arm `zenoh-service` and imports the judge `zenoh_service_arm`. The marker chains require a holder to attach and the holders to exchange samples. They require a denial of class `not-granted` with `refused=1` for a key a holder lacks. The judge requires every publication to reach as many holders as it says."
